{"instruction": "Context: HITL Rejection Learning — Previous identical alert pattern (nightly rsync from DB-01 to internal backup server 192.168.56.30, 2 GB, scheduled 01:00) was reviewed by analyst and marked FALSE POSITIVE with note: 'Documented backup job, approved change #CHG-4471'. Same pattern detected again now.", "output": "{"threat_type": "benign_scheduled_backup", "mitre_id": "T1005", "risk_score": 6, "risk_level": "informational", "analysis": "Pattern matches a previously human-approved backup job (change #CHG-4471) with identical source, destination, volume, and schedule. Learned decision from analyst review applies: this is documented, authorized data transfer.", "recommended_action": {"action_type": "no_action_close_as_benign", "target": "DB-01 to 192.168.56.30 rsync", "rationale": "Close as false positive per learned HITL decision; maintain suppression rule keyed to change ticket"}, "predicted_next_move": "None — job repeats nightly per approved schedule.", "confidence": 0.95, "status": "pending"}", "incident_type": "false_positive"}